            critical for semiconductor manufacturing&#160;&#160;Favorable Industry Trends&#160;&#160;6&#160;&#160;FAB regionalization/ reshoring of the semiconductor industry &#160;&#160;Captives increased outsourcing to merchant suppliers&#160;&#160;Node migration drives ASP expansion and revenue
            growth&#160;&#160;Foldable displays and higher value masks drive FPD opportunity&#160;&#160;&#160;Premier operational execution enables preferred supplier status&#160;&#160;Consistent delivery of cash flow for strategic flexibility&#160;&#160;Operational Excellence&#160;</font></div>
      </div>
    </div>
